-align: center\">Master tricky courses, outsmart your friends, and prove that precision and chaos can coexist on the green.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c5a1d753a08edd9435fab6d51bf5e629.poster.avif?t=1768507899\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c5a1d753a08edd9435fab6d51bf5e629.webm?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>The Calm Before the Swing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover beautifully crafted, physics-driven courses where every curve and obstacle challenges your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout of wild power-ups before each match \u2014 from boosts to shields and more \u2014 and prepare for the ultimate golf showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c8d5ad3a8f505f907e67a2173246c314.poster.avif?t=1768507899\" width=1170 height=748 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/extras/c8d5ad3a8f505f907e67a2173246c314.webm?t=1768507899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfcc\ufe0fMain Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Up to <strong>12 players</strong> in chaotic online matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong> with real collisions and trick shots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Power-ups and abilities</strong> that completely change how each round plays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Creative, handcrafted courses</strong> filled with ramps, jumps, and obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Fast-paced rounds</strong> \u2014 easy to learn, hard to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Customization</strong> for balls, trails, and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Local and online play</strong>, perfect for both friendly duels and ranked chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Regular content updates</strong> with new arenas and challenges</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to Tee Off into Chaos?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re competing with friends or mastering every course solo, <strong>Ultimate Golf Battle</strong> delivers nonstop fun, strategy, and unforgettable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your club, charge your power-ups \u2014 and let the battle for the green begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Meradon Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307610/header.jpg?t=1768507899","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mint 18 / Ubuntu 16.04.01<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300 @3.1GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 460 / Radeon 6870 / Intel HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mint 18 / Ubuntu 16.04.01<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300 @3.1GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gra